<section class="slide level2">
<h2>Not sure if this fixes the pokemon GO situation...</h2>
<div class="dada-frame-body">
<div class="center">
<div class="dada-font-footnotesize dada-hfill-layout">
<div class="dada-fbox"
style="width: 33%; border: 2px solid black; background-color: white; box-sizing: border-box;">
<img data-src="../../images/gps2.jpg" style="max-width: none; width: auto; height:4cm" alt="image" />
</div>
 
<div class="dada-fbox"
style="width: 35%; border: 2px solid black; background-color: white; box-sizing: border-box;">
